    </div>

    <p style="font-family:sans-serif;
              font-size:15px;
              color:#666;
              line-height:1.6;
              margin-bottom:8px;">
      Interested in a Ceratec home or commercial space?
    </p>

    <div style="display:flex;
                justify-content:center;
                gap:16px;
                margin:16px 0;
                flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <div style="background:#f5f5f5;
                  border-radius:8px;
